  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/iframe-embed-object.html#iframe-load-event-steps\n\nStep 4.1.3 says:\n>Mark resource timing given fallbackTimingInfo, url, \"iframe\", global, the empty string, a new response body info, and 0.\n\nBut url is not defined anywhere and is not an argument of the algorithm.",
